---
import HeroVisual from "../components/HeroVisual.astro";
import HowItWorks from "../components/HowItWorks.astro";
import ProductCapture from "../components/ProductCapture.astro";
import { getRouteById } from "../data/routes";
import { primaryCtas, siteConfig } from "../data/site";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const route = getRouteById("home");
---

<BaseLayout route={route}>
  <section class="page-section hero hero--home" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="page-section__inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1 id="home-title">A record for changing what you repeat.</h1>
        <p>Cadence is an instrument for self-directed behavioral remodeling.  Add context when it matters. Keep the full history in a portable record.</p>
        <div class="cta-row" aria-label="Primary actions">
          <a class="text-action text-action--primary" href={primaryCtas.beginRecord.href}>Begin a record →</a>
          <a class="text-action text-action--secondary" href="#how-it-works">See how the record works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual-col"><HeroVisual /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section ledger-section" aria-labelledby="decisions-title">
    <div class="page-section__inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 id="decisions-title">The decision is binary. The record is not.</h2>
        <p>Completed and Not Completed are the two possible outcomes. Unresolved means no decision has been recorded. Notes, optional timing, and changes to the behavior’s definition preserve the context around each outcome.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-ledger feature-ledger--states">
        <article>
          <div class="state-visual state-visual--unresolved" role="img" aria-label="Unresolved occurrence with Completed and Not Completed choices">
            <span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="state-visual__label">Completed</span></span>
            <span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg><span class="state-visual__label">Not Completed</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="state-description"><h3>Unresolved</h3><p>Unresolved simply means that you have not recorded a decision for that behavior occurrence.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="state-visual state-visual--completed" role="img" aria-label="Completed occurrence">Completed</div>
          <div class="state-description"><h3>Completed</h3><p>Completed means that you have completed that behavior occurrence.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="state-visual state-visual--not-completed" role="img" aria-label="Not Completed occurrence">Not Completed</div>
          <div class="state-description"><h3>Not Completed</h3><p>Not Completed means you have not completed that behavior occurrence.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <HowItWorks />

  <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="history-title">
    <div class="page-section__inner record-grid">
      <div class="stack">
        <h2 id="history-title">The definition can change without rewriting the past.</h2>
        <p>Rename a behavior or revise its description without rewriting earlier records. Cadence preserves what the behavior meant at each point in time. Per-occurrence notes add context for exceptions, conditions, and deviations.</p>
      </div>
      <ProductCapture variant="definition" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="authority-title">
    <div class="page-section__inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 id="authority-title">Observation before interpretation.</h2>
        <p>Cadence measures adherence and preserves history. It does not infer causes, diagnose patterns, or prescribe a response. Export the record with a prepared prompt when you want an AI tool to compare periods, examine notes, or produce another view. You choose whether to share exports with an external AI service. Separately, where enabled, optional Daily Brief sends disclosed context to OpenAI. Each connected source needs its own model-data choice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-example-stack" aria-label="Prepared AI prompts">
        <figure class="chat-composer chat-composer--claude" aria-label="Claude composer example">
          <div class="chat-file chat-file--claude">
            <span class="chat-file__remove" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
            <span class="chat-file__name">MyCaddenceExport.jsonl</span>
            <span class="chat-file__type">JSONL</span>
          </div>
          <p class="chat-composer__prompt">Explain patterns in failures to complete behaviors by looking at the provided additional context, including notes, behavior name or schedule changes, etc. Check adherence dips against calendar, travel, or sleep context available through Claude plugins.</p>
          <div class="chat-composer__footer chat-composer__footer--claude" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="chat-composer__plus">+</span>
            <span class="chat-mode"><span class="chat-mode__active">Chat</span><span>Cowork</span></span>
            <span class="chat-model">Sonnet 4.6 <span>Low</span></span>
            <span class="chat-send chat-send--claude">↑</span>
          </div>
        </figure>

        <figure class="chat-composer chat-composer--chatgpt" aria-label="ChatGPT composer example">
          <div class="chat-file chat-file--chatgpt">
            <span class="chat-file__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span><strong>MyCaddenceExport.jsonl</strong><small>File</small></span>
          </div>
          <p class="chat-composer__prompt">Help me understand my Decisions debt. Profile where Unresolved occurrences accumulate and how old they get.</p>
          <div class="chat-composer__footer chat-composer__footer--chatgpt" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="chat-composer__plus">+</span>
            <span class="chat-model chat-model--chatgpt">Extra High <span>⌄</span></span>
            <svg class="chat-mic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3"></rect><path d="M6 11a6 6 0 0 0 12 0M12 17v4"></path></svg>
            <span class="chat-send chat-send--chatgpt">↑</span>
          </div>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section page-section--ink" aria-labelledby="behaviorlog-title">
    <div class="page-section__inner record-grid">
      <div class="stack">
        <h2 id="behaviorlog-title">One source Record can support many views.</h2>
        <p>BehaviorLog is the data contract behind Cadence exports. It preserves behavior definitions, schedules, occurrences, decisions, status history, notes, optional timing, and revision history in files that other tools can inspect. The interface can change without rewriting the underlying history. A calendar, table, report, or AI-assisted review is one presentation of the same record.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="text-action text-action--ink" href={siteConfig.standardUrl}>Read the BehaviorLog specification →</a>
          <a class="text-action text-action--ink-muted" href={primaryCtas.downloadExample.href}>Download the example bundle</a>
          <a class="text-action text-action--ink-muted" href={siteConfig.githubUrl}>View Cadence on GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bundle-tree" aria-label="Files in the Cadence example BehaviorLog bundle">
        <div class="bundle-tree__header"><span>cadence-demo.behaviorlog.zip</span><span class="bundle-tree__meta">8 files · SHA-256 verified</span></div>
        <pre><span>├── manifest.json</span>
<span>├── schema.json</span>
<span>├── README.md</span>
<span>├── AGENTS.md</span>
<span>└── data/</span>
<span>    ├── behaviors.jsonl</span>
<span>    ├── schedules.jsonl</span>
<span>    ├── occurrences.jsonl</span>
<span class="bundle-tree__authority">    └── status_events.jsonl   ← Decision history authority</span></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section closing-section" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
    <div class="page-section__inner closing-cta">
      <h2 id="closing-title">Discover your Rythm</h2>
      <p>A single occurrence says little. A sequence begins to carry rhythm. Cadence keeps each mark distinct so the shape of a practice can emerge without being forced into a score.</p>
      <a class="text-action text-action--primary" href={primaryCtas.beginRecord.href}>Begin a record →</a>
    </div>
    <img
      class="closing-visual"
      src="/brand/cadence-horse-closer.png"
      alt="A running horse drawn in pale blue ledger lines"
      width="2172"
      height="724"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero--home{min-height:auto;border-block-end:0;padding-block-start:1rem}.hero--home .page-section__inner{min-height:auto;padding-block:2rem 1rem}.hero--home h1{max-width:16ch;font-size:2.5rem}.hero--home .hero-copy>p{font-size:clamp(1rem,1.5vw,1.1rem)}.hero-visual-col{min-width:0;width:125%;margin-left:-13.25%}
  .cta-row{gap:2rem}.text-action{font-size:1.1rem;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:4px;white-space:nowrap}.text-action--primary{color:var(--primary)}.text-action--secondary{color:var(--muted-readable)}.text-action--ink{color:var(--ink-text);font-size:.95rem}.text-action--ink-muted{color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:.95rem}
  .ledger-section{border-block-end:0}.ledger-section .page-section__inner{padding-block:4.5rem}.feature-ledger{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--line)}.feature-ledger article{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:.75rem;padding:1.75rem;background:var(--background)}.feature-ledger h3{font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.25}.feature-ledger p{font-size:.95rem}.feature-ledger--states article{gap:0;padding:0}.state-visual{display:flex;min-height:3.5rem;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;padding:.75rem 1.25rem;font-size:1rem;text-align:right}.state-visual--unresolved{gap:1.25rem;border-block-end:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--background)}.state-visual--unresolved>span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;white-space:nowrap}.state-visual__label{border-block-end:1px solid currentColor}.state-visual--completed{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}.state-visual--not-completed{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}.state-description{display:grid;gap:.75rem;padding:1.75rem}
  .record-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3.5rem;align-items:center}
  .chat-example-stack{display:grid;min-width:0;justify-items:stretch;gap:0;margin-block-start:clamp(4rem,7vw,6rem);transform-origin:top center;scale:clamp(.32,calc((100vw - 7rem) / 1880px),.7)}.chat-composer{position:relative;display:grid;width:68%;min-width:0;max-width:100%;margin:0;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:16px;background:#fff;color:#0a0b0c;overflow:hidden;zoom:.68}.chat-composer__prompt{max-width:none;color:#0a0b0c;font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2vw,1.65rem);line-height:1.35;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.chat-composer--claude{z-index:1;min-height:0;grid-template-rows:auto auto auto;justify-self:start;gap:2rem;padding:1.5rem 2.2rem 1.25rem}.chat-file{background:#fff;color:#0a0b0c}.chat-file--claude{position:relative;display:grid;width:14rem;min-height:12rem;align-content:space-between;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem}.chat-file__remove{position:absolute;top:-1rem;left:-1rem;display:grid;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:50%;background:#fff;color:var(--muted-readable);font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:300;line-height:1}.chat-file__name{font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.25;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.chat-file__type{justify-self:start;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:.15rem .45rem;color:var(--muted-readable);font-size:1rem}.chat-composer__footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem}.chat-composer__footer--claude{align-self:end}.chat-composer__plus{font-size:2rem;font-weight:300;line-height:1}.chat-mode{display:flex;align-items:center;border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);color:#92918d}.chat-mode>span{padding:.5rem .9rem;font-size:1.1rem}.chat-mode__active{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:#0a0b0c}.chat-model{margin-inline-start:auto;color:#575757;font-size:1.1rem;white-space:nowrap}.chat-model>span{color:#92918d}.chat-send{display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:2rem;line-height:1}.chat-send--claude{width:3.2rem;height:3.2rem;border-radius:12px;background:#cf6745}.chat-composer--chatgpt{z-index:2;min-height:20rem;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr auto;justify-self:end;gap:2rem;margin-top:-9rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem}.chat-file--chatgpt{display:flex;width:min(31rem,60%);align-items:center;gap:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:1rem 1.5rem}.chat-file--chatgpt>span:last-child{display:grid;gap:.1rem}.chat-file--chatgpt strong{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600}.chat-file--chatgpt small{color:#666;font-size:1rem}.chat-file__icon{position:relative;width:2rem;height:2.4rem;border:2px solid #0b7cff;border-radius:6px}.chat-file__icon:before,.chat-file__icon:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:.45rem;width:.85rem;height:2px;background:#0b7cff}.chat-file__icon:before{top:.7rem}.chat-file__icon:after{top:1.2rem}.chat-composer__footer--chatgpt{display:flex;align-items:center}.chat-model--chatgpt{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;margin-inline-start:auto;color:#999;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1}.chat-model--chatgpt>span{display:inline-block;line-height:1;translate:0 -.12em}.chat-mic{width:1.5rem;height:1.5rem;fill:none;stroke:#0a0b0c;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-width:1.8}.chat-send--chatgpt{width:3.5rem;height:3.5rem;border-radius:50%;background:#000}
  .chat-example-stack{transform-origin:top left;scale:.9}
  .chat-composer.chat-composer--claude{justify-self:center;transform:translate(-23.19%,15.72%)}.chat-composer.chat-composer--chatgpt{transform:translate(12.03%,-129.3%)}
  .bundle-tree{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--ink-line);background:var(--ink-raised);color:var(--ink-muted);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.78rem}.bundle-tree__header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;min-width:0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--ink-line);padding:.85rem 1rem}.bundle-tree__header>span:first-child{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.bundle-tree__meta{flex:0 0 auto;margin-inline-start:auto;color:var(--ink-muted);text-align:end}.bundle-tree pre{margin:0;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;padding:1.25rem;color:var(--ink-muted);font:inherit;line-height:1.8}.bundle-tree pre span{display:block}.bundle-tree .bundle-tree__authority{color:var(--ink-text)}
  .closing-cta{display:grid;justify-items:center;max-width:40rem;gap:1.25rem;padding-block-end:clamp(.875rem,2vw,1.75rem);text-align:center}.closing-cta p{max-width:38rem}
  .closing-visual{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
  @media(width < 820px){.hero-visual-col{width:100%;margin-left:0}.feature-ledger,.record-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.record-grid--reverse .product-capture{order:2}}
  @media(width < 620px){.closing-visual{height:clamp(16rem,70vw,18rem);object-fit:cover;object-position:center}.chat-example-stack{gap:1.25rem;margin-block-start:2rem;scale:1}.chat-composer{width:100%;border-radius:12px;zoom:1}.chat-composer--claude,.chat-composer--chatgpt{justify-self:stretch}.chat-composer--claude{min-height:0;gap:1.25rem;padding:1.25rem}.chat-file--claude{width:10rem;min-height:9rem;padding:1rem}.chat-composer__prompt{font-size:1rem}.chat-composer__footer{gap:.6rem}.chat-mode>span{padding:.4rem .55rem;font-size:.85rem}.chat-model{font-size:.8rem}.chat-send--claude{width:2.75rem;height:2.75rem}.chat-composer--chatgpt{min-height:23rem;gap:1.25rem;margin-top:0;padding:1rem}.chat-file--chatgpt{width:100%;padding:.85rem 1rem}.chat-file--chatgpt strong{font-size:1rem}.chat-model--chatgpt{font-size:.9rem}.chat-send--chatgpt{width:2.75rem;height:2.75rem}}
  @media (width < 620px) {
    .chat-composer { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .chat-composer__footer { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .chat-send,
    .chat-file__icon { flex-shrink: 0; }
    .chat-file--chatgpt > span:last-child { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  }
  @media(width < 620px){.chat-composer.chat-composer--claude,.chat-composer.chat-composer--chatgpt{justify-self:stretch;margin:0;transform:none}}
</style>
